    "title": "Swachhata Hi Seva 2025",
    "date": "25th September 2025",
    "summary": "Swachhata Hi Seva 2025",
    "content": "Swachhata Hi Seva 2025: Community Action for a Cleaner Tomorrow\n\nIIT Bhubaneswar joined the national Swachhata Hi Seva movement on September 25th, 2025, with an energetic cleanliness drive at the Institute Main Gate starting at 9:00 a.m.\n\nOne Day, One Hour, Together\n\nThis effort supported the nationwide 'Ek Din, Ek Ghanta, Ek Saath' campaign, encouraging citizens across India to dedicate one hour to cleanliness and community responsibility.\n\nThe morning saw inspiring participation as more than 30 faculty and staff members collaborated with 15 NSS volunteers and students to enhance the campus entrance. This joint action was part of our institute's ongoing commitment during Swachhata Pakhwada and Swachhata Hi Seva 2025 (September 1st - October 2nd, 2025).\n\nEffective Leadership and Real Results\n\nGuided by PIC Swachhata, NSS, FA Socio-culture, and AR Student Affairs, the activity proceeded with clear organization and shared purpose. The well-coordinated effort maximized impact while building strong teamwork among participants.\n\nThis initiative went beyond simply cleaning the Main Gate area—it represented our shared dedication to responsibility and service, fundamental values of the Clean and Green India mission. Student participants gained practical experience in social responsibility, teamwork, and environmental care that extends far beyond classroom learning.\n\nLiving Our Motto\n\nConsistent with the NSS principle of 'Not Me, But You,' this event showed how dedicated service and collective action create positive change. We hope this experience motivates participants to continue these values in their future endeavors, both on campus and in their communities.\n\nNSS IIT BBS\nNot Me, But You",
